  "general": {
    "description": "A telescopic aerial boom truck, for the longest reach: a three-section boom that runs out 8 m. Hold the arrow keys (lift and swing) and [ ] (the reach) to steer it from the cab, or stand in the bucket and use WASD as well; B, or the BOOM switch, drives it to its working pose or back to stowed. BEACONS runs its amber lights.",
